    "en": {
      "trackName": "Color Flow - Watch Games",
      "description": "Connect the dots, fill the board, and find your flow! Color Pipes is a beautifully addictive puzzle game, redesigned from the ground up for a perfect experience on your Apple Watch.\nSwipe to draw vibrant paths between matching colored circles. The challenge? You must fill every single square on the grid, and pipes can't ever cross! Navigate through hundreds of mind-bending levels, ranging from quick 5x5 grids to sprawling 7x7 brain-teasers. With incredibly smooth touch controls, satisfying haptic feedback, and crisp visuals, Color Pipes is your ideal companion for a quick mental workout on your wrist.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Hundreds of Handcrafted Puzzles: Endless hours of brain-teasing fun.\n• Progressive Difficulty: Start with easy grids and advance to larger, more complex challenges.\n• Intuitive Gameplay: Just swipe and connect. It’s that simple to learn!\n• Designed for Apple Watch: Enjoy clean graphics, instant loading, and satisfying haptic feedback with every solved puzzle.\n\nReady for the challenge? Download now and let the colors flow!",
      "releaseNotes": "bug fixes",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/color-flow-watch-games/id6752029081?uo=4",
